 \hypertarget{tag-02E2}{}\label{maps:eq:E.T8}
\end{equation}
The comparison therefore preserves the full outer marking.

\end{enumerate}
The finite algebra and combinatorial data are implemented in \hyperlink{prog:V:framings}{the programs in Table~\ref*{tab:V:programs}}.
\end{proof}

